{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 21, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS A SIMPLE AND STRAIGHTFORWARD STATEMENT, BUT IT LACKS THE COMPLEXITY AND DEPTH NEEDED TO DISCUSS SUCH A CONTROVERSIAL TOPIC. THE SENTENCE DOES NOT TAKE INTO ACCOUNT THE POTENTIAL CONSEQUENCES OF DISOBEYING THE LAW, NOR DOES IT CONSIDER THE DIFFERENT LEVELS OF JUSTICE AND MORALITY THAT MAY BE INVOLVED. IT SIMPLY PRESENTS A BLACK-AND-WHITE VIEW OF THE LAW, WITHOUT OFFERING ANY REAL SOLUTIONS OR ALTERNATIVES.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE ALSO LACKS A CLEAR DEFINITION OF WHAT IT MEANS BY \"BAD\" LAW. IS IT A LAW THAT IS INJUST, OR ONE THAT IS SIMPLY UNPOPULAR? IS IT A LAW THAT IS INEFFECTIVE, OR ONE THAT IS INTENTIONALLY CRAFTED TO DISCRIMINATE AGAINST CERTAIN GROUPS? WITHOUT A CLEAR DEFINITION, THE SENTENCE IS LEFT OPEN TO INTERPRETATION, AND RISKS BEING MISUSED BY THOSE WHO MIGHT ABUSE THE LAW FOR THEIR OWN GAIN. A MORE THOUGHTFUL AND COMPREHENSIVE APPROACH WOULD BE NEEDED TO DISCUSS THIS TOPIC IN A MEANINGFUL WAY.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -0.0023090388}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -0.00035089056}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -0.000283082}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.0047079194}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -4.5299425e-06}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.16702348}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.58440435}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.23184392}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": -3.0517112e-05}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.578928}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": -0.0030436642}, {"token": " THE", "logprob": -8.344616e-06}, {"token": " LAW", "logprob": -0.00019369634}, {"token": " IS", "logprob": -3.4331686e-05}, {"token": " BAD", "logprob": -4.9470633e-05}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00059146073}, {"token": " YOU", "logprob": -0.00012623466}, {"token": " SHOULD", "logprob": -0.00040892346}, {"token": " NOT", "logprob": -1.3589766e-05}, {"token": " F